;https://admin.google.com/\&quot; target\u003d\&quot;_blank\&quot; rel\u003d\&quot;noopener noreferrer\&quot; data-g-event\u003d\&quot;home: globalnav\&quot; data-g-action\u003d\&quot;admin console\&quot; data-g-label\u003d\&quot;https://admin.google.com/\&quot; data-uj-def\u003d\&quot;globalnav\&quot; aria-label\u003d\&quot;Открыть консоль администратора \&quot; class\u003d\&quot;button button--small button--low\&quot;\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;button__content\&quot;\u003eКонсоль администратора\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/header\u003e\u003cgws-action-bar\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;gws-button\&quot;\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\&quot;https://workspace.google.com/business/signup/welcome?hl\u003dru\u0026amp;source\u003dgafb-home-globalnav-ru\u0026amp;ga_region\u003damer\u0026amp;ga_country\u003dus\u0026amp;ga_lang\u003dru\&quot; data-g-event\u003d\&quot;home: globalnav\&quot; data-g-action\u003d\&quot;trial cta\&quot; data-g-label\u003d\&quot;https://workspace.google.com/business/signup/welcome?hl\u003d[hreflang]\&quot; data-uj-def\u003d\&quot;globalnav\&quot; aria-label\u003d\&quot;Начать использовать Google Workspace\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;button button--small\&quot; data-navigation\u003d\&quot;server\&quot;\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;button__content\&quot;\u003eНачать здесь\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;gws-button\&quot;\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\&quot;https://workspace.google.com/intl/ru/contact/?source\u003dgafb-home-globalnav-ru\&quot; data-g-event\u003d\&quot;home: globalnav\&quot; data-g-action\u003d\&quot;contact sales\&quot; data-g-label\u003d\&quot;/intl/ru/contact/\&quot; data-uj-def\u003d\&quot;globalnav\&quot; aria-label\u003d\&quot;Связаться с отделом продаж Google Workspace\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;button button--small button--medium\&quot; data-navigation\u003d\&quot;server\&quot;\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;button__content\&quot;\u003eСвязаться с отделом продаж\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/gws-action-bar\u003e\n      \u003c/gws-header\u003e\n      \u003cmain id\u003d\&quot;main\&quot;\u003e\n        \u003cdiv id\u003d\&quot;m1\&quot; data-module\u003d\&quot;TemplateSpacer\&quot; data-g-section-id\u003d\&quot;spacer\&quot;\u003e\n          \u003cdiv style\u003d\&quot;--gws-spacer-background-color:transparent;--gws-spacer-mobile-size:36px;--gws-spacer-tablet-size:36px;--gws-spacer-desktop-size:36px;\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;Spacer_spacer Spacer_filled Spacer_desktop Spacer_tablet Spacer_mobile Spacer_all\&quot;\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003csection id\u003d\&quot;m2\&quot; data-module\u003d\&quot;Template5050Hero\&quot; data-g-section-id\u003d\&quot;5050-hero\&quot;\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style\u003d\&quot;Grid_grid\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;Grid_grid Template5050Hero_wrapper\&quot;\u003e\n              \u003cdiv style\u003d\&quot;--gws-column-tablet-start:1;--gws-column-tablet-end:12;--gws-column-laptop-start:2;--gws-column-laptop-end:6;\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;Grid_column Template5050Hero_content Template5050Hero_fixedRightPadding\&quot;\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;Template5050Hero_heading\&quot;\u003e\n                  \u003ch1 class\u003d\&quot;Heading_heading heading Heading_size:h1\&quot;\u003eБолее эффективный подход к работе\u003c/h1\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;Text_container Text_body Text_lg Template5050Hero_body\&quot;\u003e\n                  \u003cp\u003eМиллионы компаний уже используют профессиональные версии Gmail, Календаря, Диска, Meet и других сервисов Google. Благодаря персонализированному ИИ вы сможете сосредоточиться на достижении результатов, а не на поиске информации.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;gws-button\&quot;\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\&quot;https://workspace.google.com/business/signup/welcome?hl\u003dru\u0026amp;source\u003dgafb-home-hero-ru\u0026amp;ga_region\u003damer\u0026amp;ga_country\u003dus\u0026amp;ga_lang\u003dru\&quot; data-g-event\u003d\&quot;home: hero #5050-hero\&quot; data-g-action\u003d\&quot;trial cta\&quot; data-g-label\u003d\&quot;https://workspace.google.com/business/signup/welcome?hl\u003d[hreflang]\&quot; data-uj-def\u003d\&quot;hero_5050_hero\&quot; aria-label\u003d\&quot;Начать использовать Google Workspace\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;button\&quot; data-navigation\u003d\&quot;server\&quot;\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\&quot;button__content\&quot;\u003eНачать здесь\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cdiv style\u003d\&quot;--gws-column-tablet-start:1;--gws-column-tablet-end:12;--gws-column-laptop-start:7;--gws-column-laptop-end:11;\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;Grid_column Template5050Hero_featureImage\&quot;\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style\u003d\&quot;--gws-lottie-desktop-aspect-ratio:566 / 392;--gws-lottie-desktop-height:392px;--gws-lottie-desktop-width:566px;--gws-lottie-tablet-aspect-ratio:768 / 490;--gws-lottie-tablet-height:490px;--gws-lottie-tablet-width:768px;--gws-lottie-mobile-aspect-ratio:360 / 250;--gws-lottie-mobile-height:250px;--gws-lottie-mobile-width:360px;\&quot; class\u003d\&quot;ResponsiveLottie_lottieWrapper\&quot;\u003e\n                  \u003cdiv class\u003d\&quot;ResponsiveLottie_desktopLottie\&quot;\u003e\u003cgws-lottie src\u003d\&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-workspace-assets/uploads/7uffzv9dk4sn-6KrZihieUk0j0rYZgHcqvS-a70965345cf4a6ea636d98f949e9cf18-27144_WSW_Aurora_Homepage_Desktop.json\&quot; alt\u003d\&quot;Gemini в Gmail предлагает ответ на письмо, кратко пересказывает его содержимое и составляет список задач.\&quot; width\u003d\&quot;566\&quot; height\u003d\&quot;392\&quot; controls-position\u003d\&quot;offset\&quot; wait-until-idle\u003d\&quot;true\&quot; con